\caption{MV $\Delta$F1 vs.\ $\log_2 N$ across three datasets (Qwen3-8B FT, seed${=}42$). Dashed: LP-best at $N{=}8$; dotted gray: $\Delta{=}0$. MV crosses zero on SciERC at $N{\approx}28$ and remains marginal on CoNLL ($+0.6$\,pp at $N{=}64$); LP-best at $8{\times}$ cost dominates MV at $64{\times}$.}
