Across the difficulty spectrum, MV gains range from persistently negative (Few-NERD: $-2.71$ to $-1.65$\,pp, $N{=}8$--$16$) through marginally positive only at high budgets (SciERC: crossing zero at $N{\approx}28$; CoNLL: $+0.2$--$0.6$\,pp at $N{\geq}32$; Figure~\ref{fig:n_scaling}).
LP-best at $N{=}8$ ($8{\times}$ cost) achieves gains that MV cannot match at $N{=}64$ ($64{\times}$ cost).

\paragraph{Uncertainty estimation and MBR.}
Our selection instantiates MBR decoding \cite{eikema2022sampling, denero2009fast}; despite MBR's success in translation \cite{freitag2022high} and code generation \cite{jinnai2024mbr}, all variants fail to improve over greedy due to instance degeneracy (Appendix~\ref{app:mbr_connection}).
\citet{eikema2025structured} find MBR utilities degrade on structured outputs; our four-stage cascade localizes this failure (\S\ref{sec:selection_gap}).

